---
// src/pages/legal/privacy.astro — Privacy policy
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How the FurnaceWatch website handles your information."
>
  <section class="section-sm bg-navy-50 border-b border-navy-200">
    <div class="container-fw max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="section-title text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-400">Last updated August 30, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-fw max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-navy-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-navy-900">What this covers</h2>
        <p>
          This policy covers the FurnaceWatch marketing website at www.furnacewatch.io.
          The FurnaceWatch portal at app.furnacewatch.io is governed by the service agreement
          you enter into when your organization signs up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-navy-900">What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not set cookies and does not run advertising trackers.
          If you contact us — through the demo request form or by email — we receive the
          information you send: your name, work email, company, and message. We use it to
          respond to you, and for nothing else.
        </p>
        <p>
          If our demo request form is active, submissions are delivered to us by our form
          processing provider. We may use privacy-focused, cookieless analytics to count page
          views; that data is aggregate and does not identify you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-navy-900">What we don't do</h2>
        <p>
          We don't sell your information. We don't share it with third parties except the
          service providers needed to deliver it to us. We don't add you to a mailing list
          you didn't ask for.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-navy-900">Questions or removal</h2>
        <p>
          To ask what we hold about you or to have it deleted, email
          <a href="mailto:info@furnacewatch.io">info@furnacewatch.io</a> and we'll take care of it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
